
# Agent Workflow

## Multi-Agent Architecture

User Input

↓

Symptom Analysis Agent

Purpose:
- Detect symptoms
- Identify possible health conditions

↓

Follow-up Question Agent

Purpose:
- Ask relevant medical questions
- Collect missing information

↓

Medical Knowledge Agent

Purpose:
- Analyze symptoms using medical knowledge
- Generate contextual understanding

↓

Planning Agent

Purpose:
- Determine urgency level
- Plan next actions

↓

Recommendation Agent

Purpose:
- Generate personalized health advice
- Suggest whether to visit a doctor

↓

Memory Agent

Purpose:
- Store conversation history
- Save health records
- Personalize future interactions

↓

Final Healthcare Advice
